            "review_title": "Review at Mikan Robata Japanese Seafood BBQ Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Uyen\nDa Nang, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nVery popular, great service attitude and great environment\nOct 2020\nPrice versus quality is quite cheap, because the food is delicious, fresh, mostly imported from Japan, and is processed by Japanese chefs, so it is delicious and the taste is similar to the sea. Take 4 people, average each person from 150000 - 200000, good price\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 30, 2020",
