            "review_title": "Review at Mikan Robata Japanese Seafood BBQ Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Hana\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThe food was delicious\nSep 2020\nThe food was delicious, I ate a lot but I didn't feel full, and slept very well after eating until 10am. You should order UDON noodles, and eat the recommended restaurant combo, complete and also full and cheap. Go 3 people, spend about 600,000 - 800,000 VND to be full and drunk, including drinking water. At such a price with Japanese standard quality, I feel too good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 25, 2020",
